use skill by3gus/pdf-processing
use service github://openhat/caps/services/github@main
use slash https://toolang.ai/review
use psyche toolang.ai/reviewer

service github: ```md
Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings and direct language.
```

struct ReviewFinding:
  path: string
  line: number?

struct ReviewResult:
  summary: string
  findings: ReviewFinding[]

slash review(path, focus?):
  Review {{path}} carefully.
  {{focus}}

thunk review(input, path?: path, focus?) -> ReviewResult:
  model = gpt-5
  psyches = reviewer
  skills += review, patch
  services -= linear
  tools = shell, service_use

  Review the target carefully.

  Return a precise result.
